Dear Omprakash,

I am applying for the Senior Basis Consultant position in Sovereign Cloud Delivery. This role is listed at T3, and I would be joining at T1, so I want to be upfront about that from the start.

What I bring is a strong foundation to build on: five rotations across SAP, including work with SAP Analytics Cloud, SAP Datasphere, and SAP CAP, which gave me solid insight into how SAP systems and landscapes operate together. As co-founder of NEXtickets, I have operated a live product end-to-end, which taught me firsthand what disciplined incident response, monitoring, and customer-facing reliability require in practice.

I am genuinely motivated to grow into Basis operations at the level of technical depth and customer trust this role describes, and I learn fast when working on real systems with an experienced team around me.

I finish my dual studies at DHBW Mannheim in September 2026 and hold an unconditional hire recommendation from SAP. I am also open to the security clearance process this role requires.

